{"words": [{"text": "ٱلشَّهْرُ", "translation": "The month"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَرَامُ", "translation": "[the] sacred"}, {"text": "بِٱلشَّهْرِ", "translation": "(is) for the month"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَرَامِ", "translation": "[the] sacred"}, {"text": "وَٱلْحُرُمَـٰتُ", "translation": "and for all the violations"}, {"text": "قِصَاصٌۭ ۚ", "translation": "(is) legal retribution"}, {"text": "فَمَنِ", "translation": "Then whoever"}, {"text": "ٱعْتَدَىٰ", "translation": "transgressed"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ", "translation": "upon you"}, {"text": "فَٱعْتَدُوا۟", "translation": "then you transgress"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِ", "translation": "on him"}, {"text": "بِمِثْلِ", "translation": "in (the) same manner"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "(as)"}, {"text": "ٱعْتَدَىٰ", "translation": "he transgressed"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ ۚ", "translation": "upon you"}, {"text": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translation": "And fear"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟", "translation": "and know"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "مَعَ", "translation": "(is) with"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ", "translation": "those who fear (Him)"}], "sahih": "[Battle in] the sacred month is for [aggression committed in] the sacred month,1 and for [all] violations is legal retribution. So whoever has assaulted you, then assault him in the same way that he has assaulted you. And fear Allāh and know that Allāh is with those who fear Him."}